---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page title="My Projects" path="~/projects">
    <h1>
        My Projects
    </h1>
    <div class="description">
        <p>
            Goobus - Making random things since 2026. This is a list of my projects, not counting 
            the ones from like Grade 4 (those were peak times, though I lost them).
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <div class="project-info">
            <h2>Personal Site</h2>
            <p class="languages">Astro · CSS · Typescript</p>
            <p>
                My corner of the internet - built to share my projects, practice webpage 
                design, and perhaps occasionally posting blogs. You are looking at it right
                now. It is heavily work-in-progress, and expect things to break. 
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/goobusthenoobus.github.io">Repo↗</a> · {" "}
            <a href="/">Check it out (ur looking at it rn)</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <div class="project-info">
            <h2>GoobLang</h2>
            <p class="languages">C++20</p>
            <p>
                A programming language that is suited to my taste. Heavily work in progress - 
                development is paused right now since I am a bit busy with other projects. It
                has a tree-walking interpreter right now, but will support JIT compilation in 
                the near future.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/GoobLang">Repo↗</a> 
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <div class="project-info">
            <h2>Cubeeb</h2>
            <p class="languages">C++20</p>
            <p>
                A UCI chess engine written in C++20: uses bitboards + mailbox as board representation,
                negamax alpha-beta principle variation search framework, and applies various pruning
                techniques. Also heavily WIP. 
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/Cubeeb">Repo↗</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <div class="project-info">
            <h2>Waypoint</h2>
            <p class="languages">HTML · CSS · Typescript</p>
            <p>
                A tool that stores any file into a pseudo-random GPX track, and can safely retrieve
                the file back into its original, preserving file name and extension. Shipped to 
                the <a href="https://crescent.hackclub.com/">Crescent YSWS Program↗</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/Waypoint">Repo↗</a> · {" "}
            <a href="https://goobusthenoobus.github.io/Waypoint">Check it out↗</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project">
        <div class="project-info">
            <h2>How to start coding</h2>
            <p class="languages">HTML · CSS</p>
            <p>
                A really bad site made in ~1 hour for a very brief guide on how to start
                coding. It is not a good representation of my coding skills and does not 
                contain much effort. Shipped to the {" "}
                <a href="https://boba.hackclub.com/">Boba YSWS Workshop↗</a>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/GoobusTheNoobus/BobaWorkshop">Repo↗</a> · {" "}
            <a href="https://goobusthenoobus.github.io/BobaWorkshop">Check it out↗</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</Page>

<style>

    h1 {
        margin-left: 2rem;
    }

    .description {
        color: var(--color-mute);
        font-style: italic;
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-mute);
        margin-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .description p {
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .languages {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-mute);
    }

    .project {
        margin: 1rem;
        padding: 1rem 3rem 2rem;
        
        border: var(--color-mute) 1px solid;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .project h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
</style>
